    "text": "55 minutes ago A recent Gartner survey shows that 65% of Chief Marketing Officers (CMOs) expect artificial intelligence to change their roles in the next two years. Many marketing professionals are considering how brand identity may need to adapt as technology evolves.\nThe survey results, released on Monday, indicate that marketing leaders are preparing for changes driven by AI. The full report is available to ANA members, who can also access related resources and information.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
